        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 335-LATCH, Kwikset Pocket Door Privacy Lock Latch</b> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kwikset Pocket Door Privacy Latch is a replacement latch for use with Kwikset round or square pocket door locks.  It includes a pop out edge pull integrated into the latch bolt and a round corner face plate. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nReplacement latch for <a href=\"/products/round-pocket-door-lock-privacy-kwikset-335\"><b>Kwikset Round Privacy Pocket Lock </b></a> and <a href=\"/products/square-pocket-door-privacy-set-kwikset-335-sqt\"><b>Kwikset Square Privacy Pocket Lock </b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Pocket Door Privacy Lock Replacement Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Faceplate: Round Corner</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Bore: 1\" Diameter</li>\r\n<li>Includes finish matched faceplate and installation screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
